    "period": {"data_start": "2020-01-01", "data_cutoff": "2033-07-10", "validation_date": "2033-07-11"},
    "regime_notes": "Positive and above admission gates in all three chronological thirds; strongest in the middle third, with positive persistence in the final third. Small cross-asset universe warrants conservative interpretation.",
